  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1.25² − 0.75²) / (2.25² − 1.25²) × (7 / 2)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na² − b² = (a − b)(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n1.25² − 0.75² = (1.25 − 0.75)(1.25 + 0.75)\n\n⇒ (0.5)(2) = 1\n\n2.25² − 1.25² = (2.25 − 1.25)(2.25 + 1.25)\n\n⇒ (1)(3.5) = 3.5\n\nNow substitute:\n\n⇒ (1 / 3.5) × (7 / 2)\n\n⇒ (1 / (7/2)) × (7 / 2)\n\n⇒ 1\n\n**∴ The simplified value is 1.**",
